o solve it and no by the way for  the record we do not have enough trees  out there either  but herschel walker is carrying on in  that long republican tradition of  denying that climate change exists  and then trying to reduce it to its most  ridiculous form  listen that's all the time we have for  today we got a wonderful members only  bonus show coming up for you in just a  little bit but if you want more from me  fair and cousins you can find me  youtube.com slash the ring of fire i'm  also at youtube.com slash farron  balanced and i'm twitter instagram and  facebook at fair and balanced thank you  so much for tuning in this is the david  pakman show we'll see you next time  thanks a lot for watching today's show i  just want to take a second to tell you  about today's sponsors i protect all of  my passwords accounts and devices using  aura i get instant alerts about threats  like if my email or password are found  on the dark web so i can fix the problem  fast try aura free for two weeks using  my link below
 

